      ],
      "updated": 1787919412744,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Clinic Onboarding: When new clinic signs up, we issue them a\nunique client_id (e.g., clinic_hamburg_01) and a\ncryptographically signed X.509 client certificate installed on\ntheir EMR server.\n\nPre-Request Token Fetch: The EMR server connects to\nour centralized Identity Provider (IdP)—e.g., Azure Entra\nID, Okta, or Keycloak—and presents its client_id + client\ncertificate (mTLS).\n\nIdP issues a JWT Access Token: The IdP returns a short-\nlived (e.g., 15-minute) JWT. This JWT contains specific\nclaims:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Clinic Onboarding: When new clinic signs up, we issue them a unique client_id (e.g., clinic_hamburg_01) and a cryptographically signed X.509 client certificate installed on their EMR server.\n\nPre-Request Token Fetch: The EMR server connects to our centralized Identity Provider (IdP)—e.g., Azure Entra ID, Okta, or Keycloak—and presents its client_id + client certificate (mTLS).\n\nIdP issues a JWT Access Token: The IdP returns a short-lived (e.g., 15-minute) JWT. This JWT contains specific claims:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
