    {
      "id": "maR174Ap482XClXSQo4GL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2072.6951380936052,
      "y": 433.07727147285607,
      "width": 758.17919921875,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "JcmPNINp3Gvb76dI2hPij"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 386822258,
      "version": 94,
      "versionNonce": 1883919131,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "T1Pg3m3zEpOtevoyvcy8m",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1787919402636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Healthy endpoint check: The GLB pings the /actuator/health endpoint of our\nAPI Gateways every 5 seconds.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Healthy endpoint check: The GLB pings the /actuator/health endpoint of our API Gateways every 5 seconds.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_uQ2uZ7Sqy2Y11LUGF62o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2059.725106355324,
      "y": 503.07727147285607,
      "width": 784.1192626953125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "JcmPNINp3Gvb76dI2hPij"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2074380206,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 1317814293,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787919402636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scenario A (Normal): All three AZs are healthy. The GLB looks at the current\nopen connection count. If AZ-1a has 100 active connections, AZ-1b has 80, and\nAZ-1c has 90, the GLB routes the new request from the German clinic to AZ-1b\n(the lowest load).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scenario A (Normal): All three AZs are healthy. The GLB looks at the current open connection count. If AZ-1a has 100 active connections, AZ-1b has 80, and AZ-1c has 90, the GLB routes the new request from the German clinic to AZ-1b (the lowest load).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FmP-TvOlPK2b_6pO3K76A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2062.3251124588396,
      "y": 648.0772714728561,
      "width": 778.9192504882812,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "JcmPNINp3Gvb76dI2hPij"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1686868530,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 1600599995,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787919402636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scenario B (AZ Outage): If the GLB's health checks to eu-central-1c start\nfailing (HTTP 503), the GLB marks that AZ as 'DRAINED' in its routing table.\nIt stops sending new traffic there. The next request from the French clinic is\nrouted solely to AZ-1a and AZ-1b.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scenario B (AZ Outage): If the GLB's health checks to eu-central-1c start failing (HTTP 503), the GLB marks that AZ as 'DRAINED' in its routing table. It stops sending new traffic there. The next request from the French clinic is routed solely to AZ-1a and AZ-1b.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5uX5os_kQGbRL3kUqHxLl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2054.1951991287615,
      "y": 755.5772714728561,
      "width": 795.1790771484375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "JcmPNINp3Gvb76dI2hPij"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 693330414,
      "version": 92,
      "versionNonce": 395670901,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787919402636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scenario C (Regional Catastrophe - Frankfurt goes offline): This is the GLB's\nsuperpower. If all Frankfurt AZs fail health checks simultaneously, the GLB\nupdates its DNS dynamically (TTL 60 seconds) and starts routing traffic to our\nDisaster Recovery (DR) cluster in Ireland (eu-west-1). The German and French\nEMRs will briefly see latency spikes (~30ms), but the service stays alive.\nObservability Alert: \"Frankfurt Region Unhealthy - Failover to Ireland activated\"\n-> PagerDuty Critical.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scenario C (Regional Catastrophe - Frankfurt goes offline): This is the GLB's superpower. If all Frankfurt AZs fail health checks simultaneously, the GLB updates its DNS dynamically (TTL 60 seconds) and starts routing traffic to our Disaster Recovery (DR) cluster in Ireland (eu-west-1). The German and French EMRs will briefly see latency spikes (~30ms), but the service stays alive. Observability Alert: \"Frankfurt Region Unhealthy - Failover to Ireland activated\" -> PagerDuty Critical.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "T1Pg3m3zEpOtevoyvcy8m",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1450.6451897853285,
      "y": 787.3476683165604,
      "width": 1001.0395479176518,
      "height": 397.27039684370436,
