      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787919402637,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Endpoint: Each GLB exposes a status\nendpoint, e.g., https://glb-fra-1a.health-\ncloud.de:8443/actuator/health\n\nInterval: The DNS service sends a GET\nrequest to this endpoint every 10 to 30\nseconds (configurable).\n\nTimeout: If the GLB does not respond\nwithin 2–3 seconds, the probe marks that\nattempt as a failure.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "j2yiVOMhVNtUANGM3FFSX",
      "originalText": "Endpoint: Each GLB exposes a status endpoint, e.g., https://glb-fra-1a.health-cloud.de:8443/actuator/health\n\nInterval: The DNS service sends a GET request to this endpoint every 10 to 30 seconds (configurable).\n\nTimeout: If the GLB does not respond within 2–3 seconds, the probe marks that attempt as a failure.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
